Schoenfeld, Aragon & Krieger 2013, JISSN (protein timing). Westenhoefer, Stunkard & Pudel 1999, Int J Eat Disord (rigid vs flexible restraint). WCRF Cancer Prevention Recommendations (red meat 350–500 g cooked per week). Gezondheidsraad, Richtlijnen goede voeding 2025 (red meat ≤ 200 g, legumes ~250 g, nuts 15–30 g, fish ~100 g per week). Verheggen 2016, Obes Rev (exercise and visceral fat). Voedingscentrum / Gezondheidsraad vitamin D advice. Full list: review-2026-11-audit-and-evidence.md.
